  "method": "Anonymous HTTPS with no registry credential; the only Authorization header sent is a GHCR pull token issued to an unauthenticated request. published rows are sha256 of bytes this probe downloaded, except the BSR module archive, which buf.build re-encodes on request: its row is the sha256 of the sorted sha256sum listing of the archive files, and its protos must equal the byte-pinned Geospatial.Grpc 1.0.0 nupkg protos. listed rows are registry indexes only. Blocked rows name the publication and the operator boundary and do not carry package bytes. deferred-experimental rows are channels of a component the platform manifest lists under experimental:; they are not GA evidence and not release blockers. anonymous-oci-manifest rows are container images pulled with an anonymous GHCR token: the digest is the sha256 of the manifest bytes, a multi-arch index also resolves its linux/amd64 manifest, and manifest pins must match. A floating channel tag records observed_* digests that are not compared for drift.",
